Rolling updates: 


apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: rollout-web
  labels:
    app: rollout-web
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: rollout-web
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: rollout-web
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: rollout-web
          image: nginx:1.25-alpine
** deploy: kubectl apply -f rollout-web.yaml
** rolling update: change version and run apply again. 
** command line: kubectl set image deployment/rollout-web.yaml web=nginx:1.27 alpine

